# REVIEWED: 869a6d66855e55d9
#: ../../d_query.rst:3
msgid "Query d-portal"
msgstr "Interroger d-portal"

# REVIEWED: 3ca6d77d480d8dd5
#: ../../d_query.rst:5
msgid ""
"`Dquery <https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/dquery/>`_ provides a read only "
"SQL interface to the d-portal database. This includes non-standard "
"attributes and extensions to the IATI Standard which are not displayed by "
"the d-portal site. Data can be downloaded from Dquery in XML, JSON, HTML, "
"and CSV formats."
msgstr ""
"`Dquery <https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/dquery/>`_ fournit une interface "
"SQL en lecture seule à la base de données d-portal. Cela inclut les "
"attributs non standard et les extensions de la Norme de l'IITA qui ne sont "
"pas affichés par le site d-portal. Les données peuvent être téléchargées "
"depuis Dquery aux formats XML, JSON, HTML et CSV."

# REVIEWED: b806fcdd550fd2b0
#: ../../d_query.rst:8
msgid ""
"Dquery includes example queries, and the option to view the results of "
"queries on the d-portal site."
msgstr ""
"Dquery fournit des exemples de requêtes et offre la possibilité de "
"visualiser les résultats des requêtes sur le site d-portal."

# REVIEWED: c31eefaced839721
#: ../../d_query.rst:10
msgid ""
"In depth documentation for Dquery is available on `Github "
"<https://github.com/notshi/dquery/blob/master/readme.md>`_."
msgstr ""
"Une documentation détaillée sur Dquery est disponible sur `Github "
"<https://github.com/notshi/dquery/blob/master/readme.md>`_."
